[{"title":"太学释菜古诗","author":"章懋","text":"皇明右文治，闾巷兴胶庠。\n桥门集多士，冠佩纷跄跄。\n少窥夫子宫，巍巍数仞墙。\n仰钻靡所得，矻矻穷十霜。\n剽窃糟粕馀，乘时幸飞翔。\n释褐谒阶墀，对越俨洋洋。\n采蘋荐溪毛，执爵灌椒觞。\n百拜举彝典，报本那可忘。\n平生迂腐心，峨冠讲虞唐。\n曰兹筮仕初，矢心思激昂。\n金石励名节，忠孝恒自将。\n期不负明训，允以酬君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10708,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西八景次陈石斋韵 其一 太极丸春","author":"罗伦","text":"一丸三百里，两仪位太极。\n谁从羲皇前，画此无量易。\n白日焕天章，万古永不蚀。\n吾亦欲无言，玄天本幽默。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10709,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西八景次陈石斋韵 其二 翠玄幽玩","author":"罗伦","text":"金鳌开一窦，乃透玄云麓。\n一入洞天游，火龙衔玉烛。\n仙都象卫严，永夜不得宿。\n仰视但鸿蒙，瀛海驾蟠木。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10710,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西八景次陈石斋韵 其三 金鳌霁雪","author":"罗伦","text":"东极蟠金鳌，寒通雪山白。\n祝融鞭火龙，六月销不得。\n曾上金鳌头，已在昆崙侧。\n只恐金鳌飞，白玉横天勒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10711,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西八景次陈石斋韵 其四 玉冕晴云","author":"罗伦","text":"坤厚载神秀，雨旸时若之。\n沛然泽下土，乃与天公疑。\n朝隮已肤寸，熯旱方此时。\n虹霓慎勿见，群黎生苦饥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10712,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西八景次陈石斋韵 其五 大旒垂玉","author":"罗伦","text":"大旒自何许，太乙元精倾。\n此水下无敌，上与银河并。\n一入众生口，万劫尘心清。\n万劫尘心清，万劫消心兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10713,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西八景次陈石斋韵 其六 飞舆横翠","author":"罗伦","text":"仙人此息驾，太极开鸿冥。\n如何紫盖力，敢与昆崙争。\n蔽亏三万里，昼夜移天行。\n紫气满云汉，可望不可名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10714,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西八景次陈石斋韵 其七 一峰来秀","author":"罗伦","text":"太虚忽突兀，孤碧自天拄。\n完完太极乡，浩浩阳春坞。\n万象罗两仪，俯首环内伫。\n抚掌无极翁，昨夜闻天语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10715,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西八景次陈石斋韵 其八 三峡回清","author":"罗伦","text":"百里蟠天城，天河下萦互。\n群龙沕渊潜，众蛟轻使负。\n源通昆崙丘，影接扶桑树。\n日暮闻棹歌，武夷是何处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10716,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游太极丸春次容彦昭二首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"天心开太极，天脚垂碧草。\n草根云峰青，万壁拱蓬岛。\n岛中一丸春，自此风光好。\n抚掌无极翁，苍天未曾老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10717,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游太极丸春次容彦昭二首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"太极开苍冥，天心非草草。\n四山突中峰，翠环拥琼岛。\n一丸三百里，万象各妍好。\n中有长春人，独抱春风老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10718,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游翠玄幽玩二首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"紫薇开洞天，拚此玄黄擘。\n天人好珍奇，玉府宝藏塞。\n君居南山南，我居北山北。\n尔汝两忘形，相看非物色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10719,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游翠玄幽玩二首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"玉堂囊青山，母乃巨灵擘。\n群仙燕清都，一壶春拍塞。\n紫气来青牛，窈然忘南北。\n指点极虚无，太玄本无色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10720,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠易德元陈秉常次陈石斋","author":"罗伦","text":"朝辞白沙雪，夜卧西湖月。\n湖天月在水，烱然清爽接。\n吾家富薰天，大造委此业。\n棹歌扬中流，速尔进归楫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10721,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻赵允用北行偶寄","author":"罗伦","text":"病夫懒读书，只爱华胥境。\n一榻松风清，北窗清昼永。\n合眼见周公，山童惊不醒。\n君今旅途游，莫恋邯郸枕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10722,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧龙岩次容彦昭","author":"罗伦","text":"夙昔慕至宝，寻此蜿蜒蟠。\n逶迤到龙门，落手骊珠寒。\n掌中见明月，眼底无琅玕。\n飞潜各有会，与尔隆中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10723,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何乔寿归旴江","author":"罗伦","text":"何生旴江来，鲁秀媚寥宇。\n孔门二三子，参也吾与汝。\n一片金牛云，万倾西湖水。\n去去勿复道，玄天默无语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10724,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马龙瑞芝堂咏","author":"罗伦","text":"马家真龙种，西极来流沙。\n毓此玄气精，千载成灵华。\n应图光瑞日，鸿祉熙无涯。\n浩歌灵芝辞，为我怀汉家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10725,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梁德刚","author":"罗伦","text":"南海李德孚，已从白沙老。\n西江梁德刚，枉爱青山好。\n德刚发长笑，青山莫吾恼。\n猿鹤尔勿惊，吾亦归来早。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10726,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四皓图为饶雯峰题","author":"罗伦","text":"天地有此山，直到此翁好。\n皓发惊龙颜，险语正穹昊。\n后车来飞熊，何如渭滨老。\n俛仰几嬴刘，朝夕屡荣槁。\n白云照空山，霞外迹如扫。\n至今山上芝，翳翳荒秋草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10727,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和陈白沙二首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"水云媚一窝，去天九万五。\n饥肠冰玉清，饱嚼云月苦。\n掉头懒应客，多谢巢与许。\n客去掩柴扉，随引鸡豚数。\n仰面看行云，蔼蔼翳层宇。\n庭柯鸟声和，唤醒梦中语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10728,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和陈白沙二首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"君年四十八，我年四十五。\n百年几会面，念此长恨苦。\n金台首相见，各委霞外许。\n拥怀素心人，动辄屈指数。\n贲然三子来，欢声撼茅宇。\n泷滨是曹溪，他雨对床语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10729,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松云为易德元父世衡题","author":"罗伦","text":"峥嵘白云东，松树几千尺。\n曾经秦汉来，万古横一碧。\n黑风捲青山，白昼飞霹雳。\n须臾洗层霄，见此太古色。\n茅檐清露繁，研朱点周易。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10730,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读太白诗","author":"罗伦","text":"太白横西天，万古色不改。\n至人孕元化，风豪惊百代。\n青天骑白龙，傲荡弄云海。\n太白邀我来，招手六合外。\n太白与我言，为我开天在。\n拾得白日还，迷途杳无碍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10731,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈佥宪粹之和四皓图二首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"秦坑气爇天，商山色方好。\n一鹿走寰中，孤凤鸣秋昊。\n多谢赤松徒，设网罗此老。\n片语回天心，一气嘘万槁。\n遂令箕帚妾，敢把汉宫扫。\n噫嘻隆准公，作事何潦草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10732,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈佥宪粹之和四皓图二首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"箕颍去已遥，山林复谁好。\n亦有采芝翁，皓发照苍昊。\n嗣汉配彼天，赤手藉此老。\n东邻亥字人，独伴霜木槁。\n野雉怀鸩心，火龙宜电扫。\n何乃迷先几，人彘横秋草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10733,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思亲堂为建昌王垣赋","author":"罗伦","text":"青青涧畔松，不为霜雪衰。\n凿凿涧中石，不为流水移。\n胡为白发人，忽若朝露晞。\n长夜去冥冥，儿心宁不悲。\n泣血不到地，滴著身上衣。\n衣当有时弊，儿悲无已时。\n儿身匪金石，不死将何为。\n生当长相思，死当长相随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10734,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思亲堂为建昌阎明赋","author":"罗伦","text":"仰观天苍苍，俯视地茫茫。\n天地亦何极，人命如朝霜。\n灵椿忽已摧，萱草凌北堂。\n慈乌反哺心，悲思结中肠。\n夜夜吐哀音，涕泪沾我裳。\n圆景淡无色，浮云惨不扬。\n羹墙终乃身，参闵同翱翔。\n孤芳振千载，黄泉耿幽光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10735,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题界江李文光八景继陈公甫作","author":"罗伦","text":"石斋天下士，落笔浩纵横。\n江山欲改色，星斗芒寒明。\n界江忽在手，万里随君行。\n龙眠久黄土，此画天无精。\n想当盘礴时，半夜雷霆惊。\n依依古槐柳，不谢东风荣。\n紫烟生瞑色，霁月涵秋清。\n宛宛牧童起，翳翳渔灯青。\n摩诃乱吾伊，夜静如闻声。\n舍弟广东来，念子江湖英。\n唾壶歌欲缺，玉笥嵘苍冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10736,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠容彦昭次陈石斋","author":"罗伦","text":"传呼走柴门，有客迈行只。\n衣冠不骇俗，语言多近里。\n可是白沙来，乃浑化查滓。\n白沙霞外客，兄弟遄与处。\n伯兄遣君来，此意良何以。\n肯为庙堂尊，而乃山林取。\n何由见汝兄，汝弟见可矣。\n诗好儿童传，谊高朋旧喜。\n我非青囊徒，聊尔嬉云水。\n凭君具只眼，一照三万里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10737,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用扬龟山此日不再得韵送马生归南海","author":"罗伦","text":"玄黄浩无极，沧溟忽枯桑。\n况乃么么生，浮云度虚苍。\n聚散倏忽间，惜此分阴光。\n方寸渺六合，太极丸阴阳。\n气机乘出入，寂感无边方。\n存亡繫掺舍，泰山远毫芒。\n冰渊视临履，安此终然臧。\n利剑一入腹，欲火肺肝戕。\n云子委尘泥，至宝珍秕糠。\n襟裾衣牛马，四大空昂藏。\n包羞含遗臭，焉能复流芳。\n咨尔媚学子，有欲斯无刚。\n及时醒大梦，昼夜驰徬徨。\n仁宅固云广，义路亦已长。\n居由圣所与，旷舍成荒庄。\n马生南海来，玉质披天章。\n脱迹露轩冕，游心声教场。\n谦受若虚谷，忘悔同牵羊。\n颛师学干禄，颜回诚坐忘。\n毫釐谬千里，先几宜自强。\n寒雪立未消，朔风上归航。\n脊梁尔铁硬，一担挑纲常。\n仰视白日旧，万古何当忘。\n负兹彼绵力，䀌然我心伤。\n行迈励无斁，罔念圣作狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10738,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘菊庄","author":"罗伦","text":"天台老仙伯，云是菊庄翁。\n朱颜映华发，碧眼开方瞳。\n淡荡弄云海，飘飘随西风。\n东篱下白菊，暗满黄花丛。\n夕归餐落英，为我好颜容。\n世事懒开口，薄俗争樊笼。\n黄金生羽翼，飞入蓬莱宫。\n苍生亦何罪，遭此搥炰凶。\n天命且不畏，况乃悲人穷。\n肝肺苦焦裂，耳目昭昏聋。\n悠然遂独往，长啸岩扉中。\n金丹炼玉质，曾与安期逢。\n金牛卜仁里，杖屦频春风。\n诸昆总爱客，情深非貌恭。\n盘飧称丰俭，芋栗呼儿童。\n淹留未忍去，引剑摩苍穹。\n清芬散兰雪，高綵凌烟虹。\n鲸鲵不敢动，蚊虿若为锋。\n把此共君往，前山云数重。\n得酒辄复醉，但恨糟床空。\n不学张子房，长饥从赤松。\n冥冥抚六合，造化无全功。\n男儿生世间，猥琐非英雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10739,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"存德堂为西溪何纯赋并引","author":"罗伦","text":"於维见山，赫赫武功。\n不显其忠，武岗攸同。\n允文太虚，沧洲维则。\n炳文之德，昭我南国。\n见山之族，太虚之孙。\n缵戎列祖，积德弥敦。\n式我后昆。\n诗不有言，德輶如毛。\n民鲜克举之，维何氏世举之。\n谁其风之，作颂媲之。\n维彝正甫与之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10740,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶雯峰山水四首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"混沌太古色，江山烟雾中。\n草堂无俗客，日日来春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10741,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶雯峰山水四首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"年抛造化外，气入烟霞间。\n夕阳林下路，白发照青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10742,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶雯峰山水四首 其三","author":"罗伦","text":"素琴本无弦，白云本无心。\n虚舟在野外，知他浮与沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10743,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶雯峰山水四首 其四","author":"罗伦","text":"层阴闭六合，万径无行踪。\n老翁不僵手，一丝繫春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10744,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶松坡画四首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"青山不解语，流水岂知音。\n仰面发长啸，苍苍对此心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10745,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶松坡画四首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"云移山不动，客去水相随。\n高卧南窗意，羲皇祗自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10746,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶松坡画四首 其三","author":"罗伦","text":"一棹归何处，柴桑是我家。\n莫言嫌一饱，篱下有黄花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10747,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶松坡画四首 其四","author":"罗伦","text":"笠下眼似海，驴背肩如山。\n雪月品题遍，翻笑天工悭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10748,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水小景","author":"罗伦","text":"老屋青山下，孤舟浅水边。\n黄昏鱼饭饱，榻却矮篷眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10749,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月梅","author":"罗伦","text":"广寒夜突兀，疏影自天横。\n嫦娥不敢睡，合眼梦魂惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10750,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈粹之龙","author":"罗伦","text":"北斗司元柄，南湫亦化工。\n若无天在手，泉下不相容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path